  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "With resource consent already granted for terrace housing, this substantial Milford site offers developers a valuable head start and a clear pathway towards delivery.\r\n\r\n• Approximately 5,344sqm of freehold land across multiple titles\r\n• Resource consent granted for a terrace housing development\r\n• Three-road frontage to Forrest Hill Road, Nile Road and Taharoto Road\r\n• 1 Forrest Hill Road zoned Business – Mixed Use Zone\r\n• 4 Nile Road zoned Residential – Mixed Housing Urban Zone\r\n• Existing dwelling of approximately 540sqm\r\n• Central Milford location close to shops, transport connections, schools, beaches and everyday amenities\r\n\r\nThe dual zoning across the adjoining properties creates further flexibility, with scope to maximise the site through a well-considered residential or mixed-use development.\r\n\r\nMultiple titles, three-road frontage and a highly connected location combine to create a rare large-scale development opportunity in one of the North Shore’s most established and desirable neighbourhoods.",
